Rule 6 (x and y must have broadcast-compatible shapes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (if ndim(v_1) ≥ ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)) = 0 then true else ∀ i ∈ [0, (if ndim(v_1) ≥ ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)) - 1] : ((if i < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) else 1) = (if i < ndim(v_2) then shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) else 1) ∨ (if i < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) else 1) = 1 ∨ (if i < ndim(v_2) then shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) else 1) = 1)
